## Secrets — never commit real tokens
# sys.ini holds the real BotToken/ChatId and is NOT tracked.
# The tracked template is sys.ini.example; copy it to sys.ini and fill in locally,
# or supply secrets via environment variables (Telegram__BotToken / Telegram__ChatId).
sys.ini
